# Every file in this repository is either a shipped distribution artefact or a
# copy of one. They must stay byte-identical to what is inside the release
# archive, so git must never rewrite line endings or touch the BOM.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=input would silently convert the CRLF in the
# .lng, EULA and readme files to LF on commit, and a fresh clone would no
# longer match the files that ship in Alauda_<version>.zip.
* -text

# Binary assets, so git never attempts a textual diff or merge on them.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.zip  binary
